  data: {
    LLM: "Don't 'Mitgehen' (Play) unless you have at least one high trump card or a strong side-suit Ace. If you win 0 tricks, you pay the entire pot to the next round, which is devastating.\n\nThe Sneaker's Bluff: If you hold a middling hand (one King, one 10), calling 'I'll Sneak' might scare other players into passing. If they all pass, you take the pot automatically without playing a single card.\n\nPot Management: If the pot is currently huge (due to previous Bêtes), play extremely conservatively. The risk of paying a Bête into a 100-coin pot is not worth the 25-coin payout of a single trick unless you are guaranteed the lead.",
    Player: "Don't 'Mitgehen' (Play) unless you have at least one high trump card or a strong side-suit Ace. If you win 0 tricks, you pay the entire pot to the next round, which is devastating.\n\nThe Sneaker's Bluff: If you hold a middling hand (one King, one 10), calling 'I'll Sneak' might scare other players into passing. If they all pass, you take the pot automatically without playing a single card.\n\nPot Management: If the pot is currently huge (due to previous Bêtes), play extremely conservatively. The risk of paying a Bête into a 100-coin pot is not worth the 25-coin payout of a single trick unless you are guaranteed the lead.",
